__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/
config.toml
.env
output/

# NOTE: deliberately NOT a blanket "*.sqlite3"/"data/"/"web/data/" ignore.
# config.ci.toml (committed, no secrets) points [storage].path at
# data/history.sqlite3 and [report].output_dir / export-web --out at
# web/data/ -- both are meant to be committed and grow across scheduled CI
# runs (GitHub Actions runners are ephemeral; the history has to live in
# the repo, not on the runner). Local ad-hoc runs against config.toml (or
# config.demo.toml) default to output/, which stays ignored above -- if you
# point a local config's [storage].path outside output/, ignore it by hand.
